OL,3,GNEWSAJoanna Page says male actor made
OL,4,A'awful' and 'inappropriate' comments to
OL,5,Aher on set
OL,6,
OL,7,FJoanna Page has said she was subjected
OL,8,Fto "really inappropriate" and "awful"
OL,9,Fcomments from a fellow actor while on
OL,10,Fset.
OL,12,FThe Swansea-born actress, 48, told
OL,13,Fcampmates on ITV's I'm a Celebrity...
OL,14,FGet Me Out of Here! that the unnamed
OL,15,Fmale actor had whispered "awful stuff"
OL,16,Fin her ear before a scene.
OL,18,F"He just spent the whole time just sort
OL,19,Fof making up this song and chanting
OL,20,Fabout what he was going to do to me,
OL,21,Fand nobody said anything," she told
OL,22,Ffellow campmate Mariella Frostrup.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
